	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "nE8OHUD211yxOhp7S",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 8, DX 11, IQ 12, HT 9, HP 8, WILL 12, PER 13, FP 9, SPEED 5, MOVE 5, DODGE 8, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "nZqSt184iYDx6Yp6b",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 13 (offense 14, protection -1), threat tier minor, appearing 3."
		},
		{
			"id": "nNpE0PIP9mN03XgDp",
			"text": "Longbow: Longbow (13): 1d+2 impaling, Reach Ranged, 200. A tall bow drawn to the ear. The damage is the bow's, which is why a slight archer is not a weak one."
		},
		{
			"id": "n_jHbtex1r8noZcCk",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/gray-elf.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "nj6ge5lh5PzajlISZ",
			"text": "Independent build total: 79 points of racial traits plus 20 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "n59rgRwt655kI-MXY",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Gray Elf (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nyYMMyLHPSVuZf_FI",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "n3tOxS600GJ5p8K2M",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 50 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nvB6vpj0mEDNLPfvO",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 5 (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "ndTC3O8SPomRlNmvZ",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "nvBQJEoH3R6ez5FHC",
			"text": "About 1.7 m standing, which is the SM 0 row."
		},
		{
			"id": "nAJCz__1mfk04AEHy",
			"text": "ST 8: the frailest folk in this batch, and it is the point of the record. A gray elf that could win a wrestling match would not need the rest of what it is."
		},
		{
			"id": "nr2L_CjqPdzgnaS7i",
			"text": "IQ 12 and Magic Resistance 2 together are the creature; the spells themselves are a GM's to assign, because a spell list is a character build rather than a racial template."
		},
		{
			"id": "nfblzZNbU295V8-Os",
			"text": "The longbow states literal dice, which is why a ST 8 archer is still worth avoiding."
		},
